[[:db/add "d7717cb4-ad5b-5fe5-88f7-1a9fa24d54a4" :answer/id #uuid "d7717cb4-ad5b-5fe5-88f7-1a9fa24d54a4"] [:db/add "d7717cb4-ad5b-5fe5-88f7-1a9fa24d54a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d7717cb4-ad5b-5fe5-88f7-1a9fa24d54a4" :answer/value "⟨-2y-4,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "d7717cb4-ad5b-5fe5-88f7-1a9fa24d54a4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1ce9dbfe-c27b-5acf-9e56-82d73066788d" :answer/id #uuid "1ce9dbfe-c27b-5acf-9e56-82d73066788d"] [:db/add "1ce9dbfe-c27b-5acf-9e56-82d73066788d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1ce9dbfe-c27b-5acf-9e56-82d73066788d" :answer/value "⟨2y+3,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "1ce9dbfe-c27b-5acf-9e56-82d73066788d" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f2e704d1-f888-5868-b416-4111dda80b02" :answer/id #uuid "f2e704d1-f888-5868-b416-4111dda80b02"] [:db/add "f2e704d1-f888-5868-b416-4111dda80b02" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f2e704d1-f888-5868-b416-4111dda80b02" :answer/value "⟨1+2y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "f2e704d1-f888-5868-b416-4111dda80b02" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e2b48763-94e3-5ec2-9113-cbde07237195" :answer/id #uuid "e2b48763-94e3-5ec2-9113-cbde07237195"] [:db/add "e2b48763-94e3-5ec2-9113-cbde07237195" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e2b48763-94e3-5ec2-9113-cbde07237195" :answer/value "⟨4-2y,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "e2b48763-94e3-5ec2-9113-cbde07237195" :answer/validate] [:db/add "56e51ede-6f53-57b5-bd4d-c469151cd54c" :answer/id #uuid "56e51ede-6f53-57b5-bd4d-c469151cd54c"] [:db/add "56e51ede-6f53-57b5-bd4d-c469151cd54c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "56e51ede-6f53-57b5-bd4d-c469151cd54c" :answer/value "⟨1-2y,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "56e51ede-6f53-57b5-bd4d-c469151cd54c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/id #uuid "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda"] [:db/add "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/choices "d7717cb4-ad5b-5fe5-88f7-1a9fa24d54a4"] [:db/add "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/choices "1ce9dbfe-c27b-5acf-9e56-82d73066788d"] [:db/add "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/choices "f2e704d1-f888-5868-b416-4111dda80b02"] [:db/add "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/choices "e2b48763-94e3-5ec2-9113-cbde07237195"] [:db/add "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/choices "56e51ede-6f53-57b5-bd4d-c469151cd54c"] [:db/add "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/correct "d7717cb4-ad5b-5fe5-88f7-1a9fa24d54a4"] [:db/ensure "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6c9995c5-1dc2-5c84-888e-84f7f28ad60c" :question/id #uuid "6c9995c5-1dc2-5c84-888e-84f7f28ad60c"] [:db/add "6c9995c5-1dc2-5c84-888e-84f7f28ad60c" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix."] [:db/add "6c9995c5-1dc2-5c84-888e-84f7f28ad60c" :question/worked-solution "The system corresponding to $M$ is \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=-4\\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx+2y=-4.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=-2y-4,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=-2y-4\\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\  y \\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix} -2y-4 \\\\  y \\end{bmatrix}=⟨-2y-4,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "6c9995c5-1dc2-5c84-888e-84f7f28ad60c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "6c9995c5-1dc2-5c84-888e-84f7f28ad60c" :question/answer-fields "d303c353-e333-54ee-84c5-ccd298dcfdda"] [:db/ensure "6c9995c5-1dc2-5c84-888e-84f7f28ad60c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105745 :knowledge-point/questions "6c9995c5-1dc2-5c84-888e-84f7f28ad60c"] [:db/add "b0244689-0a46-5853-9fec-f982a9fda63b" :answer/id #uuid "b0244689-0a46-5853-9fec-f982a9fda63b"] [:db/add "b0244689-0a46-5853-9fec-f982a9fda63b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b0244689-0a46-5853-9fec-f982a9fda63b" :answer/value "⟨2y-3,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "b0244689-0a46-5853-9fec-f982a9fda63b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "33b84f36-89e8-5d3d-b3f1-611c33dbd2de" :answer/id #uuid "33b84f36-89e8-5d3d-b3f1-611c33dbd2de"] [:db/add "33b84f36-89e8-5d3d-b3f1-611c33dbd2de" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "33b84f36-89e8-5d3d-b3f1-611c33dbd2de" :answer/value "⟨2y+6,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "33b84f36-89e8-5d3d-b3f1-611c33dbd2de" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5c6d713d-931f-5d2a-8804-4b697d543021" :answer/id #uuid "5c6d713d-931f-5d2a-8804-4b697d543021"] [:db/add "5c6d713d-931f-5d2a-8804-4b697d543021" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5c6d713d-931f-5d2a-8804-4b697d543021" :answer/value "⟨-2y-12,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "5c6d713d-931f-5d2a-8804-4b697d543021" :answer/validate] [:db/add "39378267-0a24-56f8-8087-d1e7ee4da02e" :answer/id #uuid "39378267-0a24-56f8-8087-d1e7ee4da02e"] [:db/add "39378267-0a24-56f8-8087-d1e7ee4da02e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "39378267-0a24-56f8-8087-d1e7ee4da02e" :answer/value "⟨2y-12,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "39378267-0a24-56f8-8087-d1e7ee4da02e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2e375b96-3cf4-5aa2-b2f2-5557565c83cd" :answer/