the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx+2y=-12.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=-2y-12,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=-2y-12\\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\  y \\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix} -2y-12 \\\\  y \\end{bmatrix}=⟨-2y-12,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "8c894149-7948-5b92-979d-5971289cdee0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "8c894149-7948-5b92-979d-5971289cdee0" :question/answer-fields "86591107-a127-5d2e-9347-404b6dcfa373"] [:db/ensure "8c894149-7948-5b92-979d-5971289cdee0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105745 :knowledge-point/questions "8c894149-7948-5b92-979d-5971289cdee0"] [:db/add "cd934be8-8701-5697-9a1c-e73f84ba0b15" :answer/id #uuid "cd934be8-8701-5697-9a1c-e73f84ba0b15"] [:db/add "cd934be8-8701-5697-9a1c-e73f84ba0b15" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cd934be8-8701-5697-9a1c-e73f84ba0b15" :answer/value "⟨3y+4,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "cd934be8-8701-5697-9a1c-e73f84ba0b15" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5f9f5b46-90ef-5f6c-b3c3-cb27660604fc" :answer/id #uuid "5f9f5b46-90ef-5f6c-b3c3-cb27660604fc"] [:db/add "5f9f5b46-90ef-5f6c-b3c3-cb27660604fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5f9f5b46-90ef-5f6c-b3c3-cb27660604fc" :answer/value "⟨3y+6,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "5f9f5b46-90ef-5f6c-b3c3-cb27660604fc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "663701ee-ea16-5abe-b654-a4259844c1de" :answer/id #uuid "663701ee-ea16-5abe-b654-a4259844c1de"] [:db/add "663701ee-ea16-5abe-b654-a4259844c1de" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "663701ee-ea16-5abe-b654-a4259844c1de" :answer/value "⟨3y-4,y⟩,\\,