blem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix."] [:db/add "5eb285d8-9be0-5d20-a475-af1d186bdad2" :question/worked-solution "The system corresponding to $M$ is \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y &=6\\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx-3y=6.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=3y+6,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=3y+6\\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\  y \\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix} 3y+6 \\\\  y \\end{bmatrix}=⟨3y+6,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "5eb285d8-9be0-5d20-a475-af1d186bdad2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "5eb285d8-9be0-5d20-a475-af1d186bdad2" :question/answer-fields "58c80288-6831-57c6-9e8b-e1cc1634b787"] [:db/ensure "5eb285d8-9be0-5d20-a475-af1d186bdad2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105745 :knowledge-point/questions "5eb285d8-9be0-5d20-a475-af1d186bdad2"] [:db/add "0a3a860b-e818-5fb7-a05e-97c8101d1c0c" :answer/id #uuid "0a3a860b-e818-5fb7-a05e-97c8101d1c0c"] [:db/add "0a3a860b-e818-5fb7-a05e-97c8101d1c0c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0a3a860b-e818-5fb7-a05e-97c8101d1c0c" :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/ensure "0a3a860b-e818-5fb7-a05e-97c8101d1c0c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6a555149-af22-5d1d-8b70-3429357ed0ea" :answer/id #uuid "6a555149-af22-5d1d-8b70-3429357ed0ea