nswer/id #uuid "2035e1bd-56b5-5578-8606-7fc651306db7"] [:db/add "2035e1bd-56b5-5578-8606-7fc651306db7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2035e1bd-56b5-5578-8606-7fc651306db7" :answer/value "⟨2y-1,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "2035e1bd-56b5-5578-8606-7fc651306db7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c55f50f3-04c9-58f0-b74c-bf451a5462e0" :answer/id #uuid "c55f50f3-04c9-58f0-b74c-bf451a5462e0"] [:db/add "c55f50f3-04c9-58f0-b74c-bf451a5462e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c55f50f3-04c9-58f0-b74c-bf451a5462e0" :answer/value "⟨2-2y,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "c55f50f3-04c9-58f0-b74c-bf451a5462e0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "452310bd-32d8-551b-9ee7-2345ff0deb23" :answer/id #uuid "452310bd-32d8-551b-9ee7-2345ff0deb23"] [:db/add "452310bd-32d8-551b-9ee7-2345ff0deb23" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "452310bd-32d8-551b-9ee7-2345ff0deb23" :answer/value "⟨1+2y,\\,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "452310bd-32d8-551b-9ee7-2345ff0deb23" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bb158a33-be60-52fe-a0ac-971d43fe8f9c" :answer/id #uuid "bb158a33-be60-52fe-a0ac-971d43fe8f9c"] [:db/add "bb158a33-be60-52fe-a0ac-971d43fe8f9c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bb158a33-be60-52fe-a0ac-971d43fe8f9c" :answer/value "⟨1-2y,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "bb158a33-be60-52fe-a0ac-971d43fe8f9c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/id #uuid "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088"] [:db/add "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/choices "2d6968fa-7e75-5f65-9340-b99eeb613b5c"] [:db/add "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/choices "2035e1bd-56b5-5578-8606-7fc651306db7"] [:db/add "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/choices "c55f50f3-04c9-58f0-b74c-bf451a5462e0"] [:db/add "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/choices "452310bd-32d8-551b-9ee7-2345ff0deb23"] [:db/add "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/choices "bb158a33-be60-52fe-a0ac-971d43fe8f9c"] [:db/add "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/correct "c55f50f3-04c9-58f0-b74c-bf451a5462e0"] [:db/ensure "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c89e5e36-218a-5433-9810-1b6f9389e970" :question/id #uuid "c89e5e36-218a-5433-9810-1b6f9389e970"] [:db/add "c89e5e36-218a-5433-9810-1b6f9389e970" :question/problem "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix."] [:db/add "c89e5e36-218a-5433-9810-1b6f9389e970" :question/worked-solution "The system corresponding to $M$ is \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+2y &=2\\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx+2y=2.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=2-2y,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=2-2y\\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\  y \\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix} 2-2y \\\\  y \\end{bmatrix}=⟨2-2y,y⟩,\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/add "c89e5e36-218a-5433-9810-1b6f9389e970" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "c89e5e36-218a-5433-9810-1b6f9389e970" :question/answer-fields "4e179302-8c5b-5fe2-bc46-441206b85088"] [:db/ensure "c89e5e36-218a-5433-9810-1b6f9389e970" :question/validate]